  <heading>DMB</heading>
  <desc>
    <brief>
      <para>Data memory barrier</para>
    </brief>
    <authored>
      <para>This instruction is a memory barrier that ensures the ordering
of observations of memory accesses, see <xref linkend="BEIIECBH">Data Memory Barrier</xref>.</para>
    </authored>
  </desc>
